     "model": "ArcOS on {model}",
     "source": "a live device: `arcos-show-version.txt` in this device's dumps reads 'Software: Arrcus ArcOS' over 'Firmware MU: EdgeCore MU 1.2.3', captured from a unit of this model in the same lab. NO ARRCUS BUNDLE PART NUMBER IS KNOWN, so `part-number` is omitted rather than invented; the model below is this library's name for the pairing and says both halves on purpose, because a model naming only the NOS could not be told from ArcOS on different metal."
    },
    "terms": {
     "bay": "Slot"
    },
